{
  "title": "Back Alley Reincarnation: Former Yakuza Is Developing His Fiefdom for His Family's Sake, So What?",
  "description": "A yakuza who lived his entire life as a lone wolf is reincarnated into another world as Ryu, the third son of a noble knightly family. For the first time, he experiences the warmth of a loving family and grows up cherished.\n\nHowever, he soon realizes that his kindhearted family, though strong in battle for generations, is hopelessly bad at business and incredibly poor! Deciding he has no choice but to step up, Ryu first sets out to reform their finances.\n\nUtilizing his mysterious \"Gokudo\" skill and knowledge from his past life's shady dealings, he successfully sells the crops he cultivates. He even makes a fortune with a food stall at a local festival, launching one new venture after another.\n\nBut as the family's fortunes rise, so too does the jealousy of worthless nobles who begin to hold a grudge against them.\n\nThe curtain rises on a fantasy about fief management, full of duty and heart, starring a kindhearted former yakuza boy!",
  "artist": "Riritto",
  "author": "Nishi no Hate no Pero",
